              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.8.2+DEU.8.3+DEU.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 8:2-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento in i udul kisa peri ikunogi ngo i langa: mbegi mir afuru ai kud i wigi ngo ku dieceng’, kara: utel wigi i gengi; kadok mbegi mi mac ku diewor, kara unyuth igi der, ku yo ma maku giwoth i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imio Tipo peri ma ber bende kara uponjgi, man itwonogi ku mana peri ngo i dhoggi, man imio igi pi ni rieu migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo, rundi pier ang’wen igwokogi i langa, e gin moko mbe m’urem igi; bongu migi de ti ngo, tiendgi de kwot ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
